    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The First Realistic Car Soccer Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for high-speed soccer action with real car physics! This game combines the thrill of driving with the excitement of competitive soccer matches. Unlike arcade-style alternatives, it features realistic vehicle handling and advanced collision mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Car Physics</strong> \u2013 Feel the weight, speed, and handling of real vehicles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting Soccer Matches</strong> \u2013 Use your driving skills to score goals and outmaneuver opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Collision System</strong> \u2013 Experience accurate car crashes and physics-based interactions.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The First Realistic Car Soccer Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for high-speed soccer action with real car physics! This game combines the thrill of driving with the excitement of competitive soccer matches. Unlike arcade-style alternatives, it features realistic vehicle handling and advanced collision mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Car Physics</strong> \u2013 Feel the weight, speed, and handling of real vehicles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting Soccer Matches</strong> \u2013 Use your driving skills to score goals and outmaneuver opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Collision System</strong> \u2013 Experience accurate car crashes and physics-based interactions.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Experience high-speed car soccer with true-to-life physics, advanced crash mechanics, and dynamic arenas. Designed for driving wheels, it offers precise handling, skill-based gameplay, and environmental destruction. Compete in ranked matches, unlock rewards, and master the game!",
